  "kind": "word",
  "headword": "none",
  "ipa": [
    "nʌn"
  ],
  "star": true,
  "levelMark": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "pron.",
      "zh": "没有任何东西；没有人"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— I’m hungry. Is there any bread in the fridge?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "None"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ", but we have cakes. Would you like to have one?"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "——我饿了。冰箱里有面包吗？\n——没有，但有蛋糕。你想要一个吗？"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "none 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握 none 的习惯用法，及比较与 neither 和 no one 的用法区别。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "none"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 指三者及以上的人或物，表示“没有一个”的意思。另外，none 后常接 of 短语，of 后可接可数名词或代词；作主语时，谓语动词用单、复数形式皆可；of 后也可接不可数名词，这时谓语动词必须用单数形式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "neither"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 指两者中“没有一个”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "no one"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " = nobody，只指人，表示“没有人”，不能指物，后面不能接 of 构成的短语。no one 作主语时，谓语动词只能用单数形式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Sorry, but "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "none of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " us speaks/speak English."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "抱歉！我们中没有一个人会讲英语。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "None of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the money on the desk is mine. 桌上的那些钱都不是我的。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "There are many apples in the basket, but "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "none of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " them are fresh."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "篮子里有很多苹果，但没有一个是新鲜的。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "There are two apples on the plate, but "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "neither of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " them is fresh."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "盘子里有两个苹果，但没有一个是新鲜的。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "No one/Nobody"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " likes a person with bad manners."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "不讲礼貌的人没有人喜欢。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "注意："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "none"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 用来回答 How many… 或 How much… 引起的问句以及含“any (one) of + 名词”构成的一般疑问句。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "no one/nobody"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 用来回答 Who… 引起的问句及含 anyone/anybody 的一般疑问句。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "nothing"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 用来回答 What… 引起的问句及含 anything 的一般疑问句。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：① — How much water is there in the bottle?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— None."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——瓶子里有多少水？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——一点儿也没了。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "② — Did any one of the passengers get injured in the accident?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— No, none was injured."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——有乘客在这场意外中受伤吗？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——不，没人受伤。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "③ — Who will go to the party?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— No one/Nobody."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——谁会去派对？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——没人去。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "④ — Did anyone want to attend the meeting?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— No, no one/nobody wanted to."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——有谁想参加那场会议吗？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——不，没人想去。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "⑤ — What’s in your hand?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— Nothing."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——你手里有什么？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——什么也没有。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "⑥ — Do you have anything else to say for yourself?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— No, nothing else."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——你还有什么要为自己说的吗？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——没有了。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
